  "description": "Lightweight, capable and refreshingly uncomplicated.\nThe Original Bullitt strips cargo biking back to the essentials. No motor, no battery, no charging routine – just a strong frame, efficient design and a ride that feels more like a bicycle than most cargo bikes ever manage. In many ways, it's a bike first and a cargo bike second.\nIts low weight and responsive handling make heavy loads feel surprisingly manageable, while the simple mechanical setup means most things can be fixed with bicycle tools rather than software updates. Whether it's work, shopping or everyday transport, it's a bike that's always ready to go.\nNothing fancy. Just a Bullitt.",
